[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この辺りなら魔物の気配もない。小休止できそうだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No signs of monsters around here. We can take a short break."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃあ私、お団子とお茶の用意をしますね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "In that case, I'll prepare some desserts and tea!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やったー！\nレスナちゃんのお団子だ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yaaay! Resna's desserts!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "食べさせてもらえる？\u3000あーんするから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "May I have some? Here, say 'aah.'"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、は、はい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "O-oh, sure!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……美味しいわね。私は作ったことがないから新鮮",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...This is delicious. I've never made these myself, so it's quite novel."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "クリセルダさんもお菓子を作るんですよね？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But you make sweets too, don't you, Criselda?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。お菓子作りは好きよ。\n美味しい料理は心を豊かにするでしょう？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, I do enjoy making desserts. Good food nourishes the soul, wouldn't you agree?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そういえばヴァレリアも、クリセルダさんの\nお弁当が美味しかったって言ってた……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come to think of it, Valeria mentioned how delicious your boxed lunches were..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よかったら今度、みんなにご馳走するわよ。\nもちろん、ヴァレリアにもね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If you'd like, I'll cook for everyone sometime. Including Valeria, of course."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "きっとすっごい勢いで食べるんだろうなー。\n美味しいって言いながら！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I bet she'll wolf it down super fast, saying how good it is the whole time!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "目に浮かぶわね。\n彼女は本当に美味しそうに食べてくれるから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I can picture it now. She always eats with such genuine enjoyment."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナちゃん。絶対に上手くいくよ。\nヴァレリアが治るまで、あと一息だ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't worry, Resna! We're almost there. Just a little more until Valeria's back with us!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "イザナちゃん……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ううん、頑張ったのは私だけじゃない。\n先輩方の支えもあったし、何より……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, I didn't do this alone. I had help from my seniors, and more importantly..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "イザナちゃんがずっとそばにいて、\n私の心を守ってくれたおかげだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You've been by my side this whole time, keeping my spirits up."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "イザナちゃん、本当にありがとう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you so much, Izana."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えへへ、なんか照れちゃうな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe, you're making me blush..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "イザナちゃんには、すっごく助けてもらったから\n何かお礼をしなくちゃね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You've helped me so much, I really need to thank you properly!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃあじゃあ！\nいつもより念入りにブラッシングしてほしい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ooh, ooh! Then I want an extra thorough brushing!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん、任せて！\n……それじゃあ、早速",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Leave it to me! ...Alright, let's start..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふわあぁ……んふう……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mmmmm... that feels nice..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "優しく丁寧に……イザナちゃん、ここだよね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nice and gentle... This spot here, right, Izana...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うにゃ～～～～～ん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nyaaaaaa~"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それで、ここはちょっと強めに……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And here, a bit firmer..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ンルルルル～～～！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Purrrrrrrr!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふわふわ……かわいい……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So fluffy... How adorable..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]